Short:        Util for use with Dme editor & DevPac. V1.1
Author:       Nic Wilson
Version:      1.1
Architecture: m68k-amigaos
Source:       Fish collection

A utility for those who use Matt Dillon's Dme editor and HighSoft's DevPac
Assembler.  DmeAsm is a CLI command file that takes your source code as a
parameter and opens a window similar to the Assemble window inside Devpac
(Genam2) and gives similar options.  If no parameter is supplied then the
window will still open and you can supply your own.  
